                    <h1 class="content-title">Overview & <span class="gradient-text">Architecture</span></h1>
                    <p class="content-subtitle">
                        Understand what IRM is, why it replaced GRC, and how its layered architecture 
                        connects risk management to the rest of the Now Platform.
                    </p>
